<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Compelling evidence, but not conclusive, CEO.\'92 Gerry shifted his weight. Beneath him, a dark shape drifted through the Layer like a plastic bag with ambitions. \'91And if Chantara\'92s health is due to the TPlusVirus, there\'92s little evidence that he\'92s spreading it.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Dunhilton seized on that. \'91
