\f1\i0 ? It\'92s transmitted sexually, isn\'92t it? Don\'92t we just find out who Chantara\'92s been fucking and see how their health is?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Well, it\'92s long been government policy to contain the Ghetto rather than police it or monitor it in any way.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91A policy which needs revising, wouldn\'92t you say?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Yes, CEO. I\'92ll see to it immediately.\'92 Gerry contemplated. \'91There is a rumour he has a fan club. I\'92ll look into it.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91So you only recovered the Parramatta virus? Not the Gummy Bear Virus as well?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We only recovered the TMinusVirus,\'92 Gerry said flatly.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91The what?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Gerry reluctantly modified his answer. \'91The Parramatta virus.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91So the Gummy Bear Virus is still contained? In the last lab, under Jamison Tower?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Either there or in an unknown location.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We must ensure no more labs are unsealed,\'92 Dunhilton ordered.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Arrangements are being made.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Good.\'92 Dunhilton sank a centimetre deeper into the pool, which Gerry interpreted as satisfaction. \'91Did you ever find Hermann and Anstey?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Gerry smiled. \'91As a matter of fact, we did. In the last lab under the Pale.\'92 There was a pause. \'91Dead, of course.\'92\
