<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Outstanding.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91And their hair was perfect.\'92 Gerry smiled.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Dunhilton couldn\'92t tell if he was being baited, so he let it slide. The floor beneath the pool gave a faint creak. Gerry\'92s knuckles whitened on the rim.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Settle down, Gerry. It\'92s rated for twice this weight.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Comforting, CEO.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91So how long before we can deploy the Parramatta Virus against the Elvi?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>This was the question Gerry was loath to answer. \'91We\'92ve recovered a great deal of documentation; there is much to digest. The research team estimates between two and three months.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Three months?\'92 Dunhilton blustered. \'91We haven\'92t got that kind of time. The Elvi are united and armed, Gerry.\'92 Dunhilton took a breath. \'91And they\'92re getting 
